{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21309","headline":"追昔游 · 元稹","name":"追昔游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢傅堂前音乐和，狗儿吹笛胆娘歌。\n花园欲盛千场饮，水阁初成百度过。\n醉摘樱桃投小玉，嬾梳丛鬓舞曹婆。\n再来门馆唯相吊，风落秋池红叶多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}